  "id": "amuck",
  "term": "amuck",
  "definition": "Amuck refers to a frenzied, violent state historically described in relation to intoxication from cannabis preparations, in which a person rushes about blindly and may attack others with impulsive destructiveness. The expression was also later used more loosely for reckless or blindly aggressive behavior.",
